WEBVTT

00:15:29.528 --> 00:15:32.783
And this is called the three-to-one
positive emotion ratio.

00:15:32.807 --> 00:15:35.465
It's my favorite
SuperBetter trick, so keep it up.

00:15:35.489 --> 00:15:37.560
All right, pick one, last quest:

00:15:37.584 --> 00:15:39.416
Shake someone's hand for six seconds,

00:15:39.440 --> 00:15:41.147
or send someone a quick thank you

00:15:41.171 --> 00:15:43.077
by text, email, Facebook or Twitter. Go!

00:15:43.101 --> 00:15:48.045
(Chatting)

00:15:48.069 --> 00:15:49.764
Looking good, looking good.

00:15:51.486 --> 00:15:52.691
Nice, nice.

00:15:53.565 --> 00:15:54.628
Keep it up.

00:15:55.347 --> 00:15:56.348
I love it!

00:15:56.372 --> 00:15:59.764
All right, everybody,
that is +1 social resilience,

00:15:59.788 --> 00:16:03.011
which means you actually get
more strength from your friends,